<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 25-28.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 25-28.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 25-28. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     July 25-28	July 24-25</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42872	    0.42778</p>
<p>    DKK    2.101		2.10148</p>
<p>    FIM    2.7053	     2.71663</p>
<p>    GBP   24.44035	   24.47309</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07483	    0.07483</p>
<p>    LTL    3.66661	    3.65322</p>
<p>    LVL   25.2939	    25.2581</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00253	    0.00252</p>
<p>    SEK    1.85701	    1.86372</p>
<p>    UAH    7.89919	    7.86948</p>
<p>    USD   14.6692	    14.6156</p>
<p>    XEU   15.83687	   15.83966</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
